[API Documentation]
Computes a partial inverse of :class:`MaxPool3d`.

    :class:`MaxPool3d` is not fully invertible, since the non-maximal values are lost.
    :class:`MaxUnpool3d` takes in as input the output of :class:`MaxPool3d`
